    {
      "id": "lesson_17c87248-a3cb-4db0-b5e4-8cc0d2b7f604",
      "name": "It's important.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_0bef647b-47b5-49cb-bad9-4ab814d5c932",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Mira esto:\n\n**Import==ante==** es **import==ant==**.\n\n**Const==ante==** es **const==ant==**."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_ff925d63-9566-4f10-8acd-605c33900bf5",
          "type": "sentence",
          "layout": "vocabulary_table",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "",
          "helperText": "",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_45604f07-6242-4ed6-90b4-b803e113054a",
              "spanish": "importante",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "important"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            },
            {
              "id": "lang_7ccb8852-e35b-47f8-9370-c7621314d555",
              "spanish": "constante",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "constant"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block_55c01a04-c00c-40df-ad70-7cbee9713cf8",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Como puedes ver, muchas palabras que terminan en ==-ante== cambian a ==-ant== en inglés.\n\nSolo quitamos la ==e==.\n\nHay cientos de palabras así."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_d46a2d99-2bfd-49bf-a52e-bfcabbf159be",
          "type": "sentence",
          "layout": "vocabulary_table",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "Adivina los siguientes.",
          "helperText": "",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_d6bc53c5-0206-435d-8abd-3539b92be181",
              "spanish": "instante",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "instant"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            },
            {
              "id": "lang_ee109b71-f68e-470d-8a4e-90d1f9c18fac",
              "spanish": "distante",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "distant"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block_49906138-c812-442c-a2bd-0b175889cd7d",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Ahora la pronunciación:\n\n**Important** se pronuncia **im-POR-tent**: tres sílabas.\n\n**Constant** se pronuncia **KAHN-stent**: dos sílabas.\n\nAl final, ==-ant== suele sonar parecido a **ent**."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_d90b38e9-cf78-44a6-8499-2f511af08426",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Ahora mira estos:\n\n**Perman==ente==** es **perman==ent==**.\n\n**Pres==ente==** es **pres==ent==**."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_4d05fde4-af9e-4889-a0ba-3bbb1e69541f",
          "type": "sentence",
          "layout": "vocabulary_table",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "",
          "helperText": "",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_c090b702-f706-43c0-b38e-9ebaff45e74e",
              "spanish": "permanente",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "permanent"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            },
            {
              "id": "lang_64abb4b8-dbdf-48b0-b3d4-9a3ef570c6a0",
              "spanish": "presente",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "present"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block_5469b7a1-a2d8-4adc-ad62-b95fec33c936",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Como puedes ver, muchas palabras que terminan en ==-ente== cambian a ==-ent== en inglés.\n\nSolo quitamos la ==e==.\n\nTambién hay muchas palabras así."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_11169bc2-bab8-44e2-9df9-b3c66c57822d",
          "type": "sentence",
          "layout": "vocabulary_table",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "Adivina los siguientes.",
          "helperText": "",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_0628ae1d-f2f7-4bd1-8072-c1e207078eeb",
              "spanish": "competente",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "competent"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            },
            {
              "id": "lang_74de734a-cd55-420e-b7e8-6c007be8ad21",
              "spanish": "urgente",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "urgent"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block_ef05770a-83e6-4c73-b70b-7c8f3e8840bf",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Ahora la pronunciación:\n\n**Permanent** se pronuncia **PER-muh-nent**: tres sílabas.\n\n**Present** se pronuncia **PREZ-ent**: dos sílabas."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_f84b15d1-2ae7-4854-b2bf-58e3f5ddbc3a",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Mira este cambio:\n\n**Diferente** es **different**.\n\nEn inglés, recuerda las dos efes: ==diff...==\n\nEn Norteamérica se pronuncia **DIFF-rent**: dos sílabas.\n\n**DIFF-rent.**"
        },
        {
          "id": "block_52577bde-5122-42bf-a2ca-f32155d55a8a",
          "type": "sentence",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "",
          "helperText": "",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_e9a11f6d-80fa-413b-897f-a1b81046f1be",
              "spanish": "diferente",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "different"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block_354782e3-c4dc-4464-85c8-a1782779c2e1",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "Mira este cambio:\n\n**Paciente** es **patient**.\n\nLa ==c== de paciente cambia a ==t==: ==pati...==\n\nEn Norteamérica se pronuncia **PAY-shent**: dos sílabas.\n\n**PAY-shent.**"
        },
        {
          "id": "block_a39f0792-cb84-4c22-b615-880622cbeb7b",
          "type": "sentence",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "",
          "helperText": "",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_2e2a1e06-32de-47f3-add9-6f88967fdf7d",
              "spanish": "paciente",
              "callout": null,
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "patient"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block_6053d86f-d95e-4991-b4e2-f40d1fc917bb",
          "type": "explanation",
          "contentMarkdown": "==Es== puede ser ==it is==. La contracción es ==it's==, con apóstrofo. Aquí significan lo mismo.\n\n==It is== se pronuncia **it-IZ**: dos sílabas.\n\n==It's== se pronuncia **ITS**: una sílaba."
        },
        {
          "id": "block_bed7e3e0-8e00-45e8-9d6d-22d43f30a84a",
          "type": "sentence",
          "promptLabel": "",
          "promptText": "",
          "helperText": "==It is== y ==it's== son iguales.",
          "answerFeedback": null,
          "conceptLinks": [],
          "languageBlocks": [
            {
              "id": "lang_85ea970b-533b-492e-86a9-a609ed9dc72e",
              "spanish": "Es",
              "callout": "¡Mayúscula!",
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "It is",
                "It's"
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            },
            {
              "id": "lang_d2273583-43c5-43b4-8bca-8fbec6d6b563",
              "spanish": "importante.",
              "callout": "¡Punto!",
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "important."
              ],
              "conceptLinks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
